"<a href=\"http://github.com/privacyidea/privacyidea\" target=\"github\">"
"repozytorium\n"
"backendu</a>."

#: privacyidea/static/app.js:160
msgid "The privacyIDEA system seems to be offline. The API is not reachable!"
msgstr "System privacyIDEA jest offline. API nie odpowiada!"

#: privacyidea/static/components/config/views/config.token.question.html:3
msgid ""
"The questionnaire lets you define a set of questions. The questionnaire\n"
"    token needs to define answers to these questions and the user will be\n"
"    presented with a random questions and needs to provide his previously\n"
"    defined answer."
msgstr ""
"Kwestionariusz pozwala zdefiniować zestaw pytań. Token z pytaniami "
"przechowuje\n"
"odpowiedzi na te pytania. Użytkownik otrzyma losowe pytanie i musi podać\n"
"wcześniej zapisaną odpowiedź."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.registration.html:1
msgid ""
"The registration token is a code, that the user can use to authenticate "
"once!\n"
"    After using this code to login, the registration token is deleted and "
"can\n"
"    not be used anymore."
msgstr ""
"Token rejestracyjny to kod jednorazowego uwierzytelnienia. Po zalogowaniu "
"tym\n"
"kodem token jest usuwany i nie można go użyć ponownie."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.remote.html:1
msgid ""
"The remote token forwards the authentication request to another\n"
"    privacyIDEA server. You can choose if the PIN should be stripped and\n"
"    checked locally."
msgstr ""
"Token zdalny przekazuje żądanie uwierzytelnienia do innego serwera\n"
"privacyIDEA. Możesz wybrać, czy PIN ma zostać usunięty z żądania i "
"sprawdzony\n"
"lokalnie."

#: privacyidea/static/app.js:92
msgid "The resource name must consist of letters, numbers and '_', '-', '.'"
msgstr ""
"Nazwa zasobu może zawierać tylko litery, cyfry oraz znaki '_', '-' i '.'."

#: privacyidea/static/app.js:102
msgid ""
"The resource name must consist of letters, numbers and '_', '-', '.' and "
"must not be the word 'send_test_email'"
msgstr ""
"Nazwa zasobu może zawierać tylko litery, cyfry oraz znaki '_', '-' i '.' "
"oraz\n"
"nie może być słowem 'send_test_email'."

#: privacyidea/static/app.js:97
msgid ""
"The resource name must consist of letters, numbers and '_', '-', '.' and "
"must not be the word 'test'"
msgstr ""
"Nazwa zasobu może zawierać tylko litery, cyfry oraz znaki '_', '-' i '.' "
"oraz\n"
"nie może być słowem 'test'."

#: privacyidea/static/app.js:107
msgid ""
"The resource name must consist of letters, numbers and '_', '-', '.' and "
"must not be the word 'test_request'"
msgstr ""
"Nazwa zasobu może zawierać tylko litery, cyfry oraz znaki '_', '-' i '.' "
"oraz\n"
"nie może być słowem 'test_request'."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.4eyes.html:15
msgid ""
"The separator that is used to separate the passwords of the\n"
"        different tokens."
msgstr "Separator haseł poszczególnych tokenów."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.remote.html:28
msgid "The serial number on the remote server"
msgstr "Numer seryjny na serwerze zdalnym"

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.lost.html:38
msgid ""
"The serial of the new token is\n"
"        <a ui-sref=\"token.details({tokenSerial:lostResult.serial})\">\n"
"        {{ lostResult.serial }}</a>."
msgstr ""
"Numer seryjny nowego tokena to\n"
"        <a ui-sref=\"token.details({tokenSerial:lostResult.serial})\">\n"
"        {{ lostResult.serial }}</a>."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.hotp.html:24
#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.totp.html:24
msgid ""
"The server will create the OTP key\n"
"            and a QR Code\n"
"            will be\n"
"            displayed to you to be scanned."
msgstr ""
"Serwer utworzy klucz OTP\n"
"            i wyświetli kod QR do zeskanowania."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.certificate.html:73
msgid ""
"The server will create the private RSA key and return it with\n"
"                    the certificate in an encrypted PKCS#12 container."
msgstr ""
"Serwer utworzy prywatny klucz RSA i zwróci go wraz z certyfikatem\n"
"w zaszyfrowanym kontenerze PKCS#12."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.daypassword.html:20
msgid ""
"The server will create the secret and a QR Code\n"
"            will be displayed for you to be scanned."
msgstr "Serwer utworzy sekret i wyświetli kod QR do zeskanowania."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.motp.html:16
msgid ""
"The server will create the secret key\n"
"            and a QR Code\n"
"            will be\n"
"            displayed to you to be scanned with the Token2 app."
msgstr ""
"Serwer utworzy tajny klucz i wyświetli kod QR do zeskanowania aplikacją\n"
"Token2."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.applspec.html:16
msgid "The server will create the static password."
msgstr "Serwer utworzy hasło statyczne."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.html:146
msgid ""
"The start time and the end time of the validity period\n"
"                    should be entered in the format\n"
"                    <em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm+oooo</em>."
msgstr ""
"Czas rozpoczęcia i zakończenia okresu ważności wpisz w formacie\n"
"<em>YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm+oooo</em>."

#: privacyidea/static/components/config/views/config.token.email.html:20
#: privacyidea/static/components/config/views/config.token.sms.html:25
msgid ""
"The time in seconds for which the sent OTP value is valid for\n"
"        authentication."
msgstr "Czas ważności wysłanego kodu OTP w sekundach."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.daypassword.html:54
msgid "The time in which the password can be used. For example '1d' or '12h'."
msgstr "Czas ważności hasła, np. '1d' lub '12h'."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.html:194
msgid ""
"The token has been enrolled in the container\n"
"            <a ui-sref=\"token.containerdetails({containerSerial: "
"enrolledToken.container_serial})\">\n"
"                {{ enrolledToken.container_serial }}\n"
"            </a>."
msgstr ""
"Token został zarejestrowany w kontenerze\n"
"            <a ui-sref=\"token.containerdetails({containerSerial: "
"enrolledToken.container_serial})\">\n"
"                {{ enrolledToken.container_serial }}\n"
"            </a>."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.details.html:615
msgid ""
"The token is currently assigned to container\n"
"    <a ui-sref=\"token.containerdetails({containerSerial: containerSerial})"
"\" ng-hide=\"!checkRight('container_list')\">\n"
"        {{ containerSerial }}\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <span ng-hide=\"checkRight('container_list')\">{{ containerSerial }}</"
"span>\n"
"    ."
msgstr ""
"Token jest obecnie przypisany do kontenera\n"
"    <a ui-sref=\"token.containerdetails({containerSerial: containerSerial})"
"\" ng-hide=\"!checkRight('container_list')\">\n"
"        {{ containerSerial }}\n"
"    </a>\n"
"    <span ng-hide=\"checkRight('container_list')\">{{ containerSerial }}</"
"span>\n"
"    ."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.details.html:623
msgid "The token is currently in no container."
msgstr "Token nie znajduje się obecnie w żadnym kontenerze."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enrolled.u2f.html:34
#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enrolled.webauthn.html:32
msgid "The token is enrolled."
msgstr "Token został zarejestrowany."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.lost.html:52
msgid "The token is valid till {{ lostResult.end_date }}."
msgstr "Token jest ważny do {{ lostResult.end_date }}."

#: privacyidea/static/components/directives/views/directive.verifyEnrolledToken.html:19
msgid ""
"The token was enrolled, but it still needs to be verified. Please enter the "
"verification value."
msgstr ""
"Token został zarejestrowany, ale wymaga jeszcze weryfikacji. Wprowadź "
"wartość weryfikacyjną."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.lost.html:34
msgid "The token was marked lost successfully."
msgstr "Oznaczono token jako utracony."

#: privacyidea/static/components/token/views/token.enroll.html:179
msgid ""
"The token was successfully enrolled with serial number\n"
"            <a ui-sref=\"token.details({tokenSerial:enrolledToken.serial})"
"\">\n"
"                {{ enrolledToken.serial }}</a>\n"
"            for user\n"
"            <a ui-sref=\"user.details({username:newUser.user, "
